---
---

<section class="hero reveal" style="--i: 0" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__main">
    <p class="hero__kicker"><span class="hero__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Disponible para trabajar · Palmira, Colombia</p>
    <h1 class="hero__display" id="hero-title">Jean Tigreros — desarrollo web y sistemas, de la idea al servidor.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">Tengo 21 años y estudio ingeniería de sistemas en la UNAD. Trabajo freelance: páginas web, backends pequeños y fierros que terminan sirviendo tráfico real en mi red local.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="hero__link" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/resume.pdf"} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Descargar CV →</a>
      <a class="hero__link hero__link--quiet" href="mailto:jtigreros92@gmail.com">Escríbeme ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="hero__proof" aria-label="Estado actual">
    <dl class="proof">
      <div class="proof__row"><dt>ubicación</dt><dd>América/Bogotá · <span id="time">—</span></dd></div>
      <div class="proof__row"><dt>foco</dt><dd>web · linux · datos</dd></div>
      <div class="proof__row"><dt>ahora</dt><dd>4 proyectos publicados</dd></div>
      <div class="proof__row"><dt>contacto</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/jeantigreros" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a> · <a href="https://x.com/nekro24" target="_blank" rel="noopener">x</a> · <a href="https://co.linkedin.com/in/jean-carlos-tigreros-0187b12b5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>

<script>
  (function () {
    var el = document.querySelector("#time");
    if (el) {
      var fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("es-CO", { timeZone: "America/Bogota", hour: "numeric", minute: "2-digit" });
      el.textContent = fmt.format(new Date());
      setInterval(function () { if (el) el.textContent = fmt.format(new Date()); }, 30000);
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md) var(--space-xl);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .hero__kicker {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  .hero__dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent); flex: none; }
  .hero__display {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-display-s);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .hero__lede {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  }
  .hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-md); }
  .hero__link {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-height: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero__link:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  .hero__link--quiet { color: var(--color-ink); }
  .hero__proof {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .proof { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
  .proof__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .proof__row dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .proof__row dd { margin: 0; color: var(--color-ink-2); min-width: 0; }
  .proof__row dd a { color: var(--color-ink); }
  #time { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: var(--space-2xl); padding-top: var(--space-3xl); }
    .hero__proof { border-top: none; border-left: 1px solid var(--color-rule); padding-top: 0; padding-left: var(--space-xl); align-self: start; }
  }
</style>
